# The repo root is the build context for simulator/Dockerfile and
# emulator/Dockerfile (both compose files set `context: ..`). Whitelist
# exactly the trees those Dockerfiles COPY so the context upload stays small
# (no .git, no node_modules, no local build output) and so local artifacts
# can never bust or poison the source COPY layers: a CI checkout contains
# none of them, and excluding them here makes a local build byte-identical
# to CI's.
*
!components/
!main/
!simulator/engine/
!simulator/gosim/
!simulator/scenarios/
!simulator/ui/
!test/stubs/
!emulator/node/
# Generated or locally installed artifacts inside the whitelisted trees.
# Every path here is gitignored; keep the two lists in step.
simulator/ui/node_modules
simulator/ui/dist
simulator/gosim/bramble-gosim
simulator/gosim/cover.out
emulator/node/build
emulator/node/build-heltec
emulator/node/managed_components
emulator/node/dependencies.lock
emulator/node/sdkconfig
emulator/node/sdkconfig.old
emulator/node/sdkconfig.heltec
emulator/node/sdkconfig.heltec.old
